# Testing

## Current state

- Only `test/widget_test.dart` exists — default counter smoke test (does **not** match this app).
- No `integration_test/` suite.
- No project mocking package yet (no mockito/mocktail in `pubspec.yaml`).

## When adding tests

Prefer meaningful coverage over keeping the broken counter test:

| Layer | What to test | Location |
|-------|--------------|----------|
| Domain use cases | fold success/failure with fake repos | `test/features/<f>/domain/` |
| RepositoryImpl | `safeCall` mapping + cache fallback | `test/features/<f>/data/` |
| Cubit | Loading → Loaded/Error; pagination flags | `test/features/<f>/presentation/` |
| Widgets | loading/empty/error UI with BlocProvider | `test/features/<f>/` or `test/shared/` |

## Conventions

- Mirror `lib/` paths under `test/`.
- Name files `*_test.dart`; describe behavior, not implementation details.
- Fake/stub repository contracts instead of hitting Dio/Hive in unit tests.
- If introducing mocks, add **mocktail** (or mockito) explicitly to `dev_dependencies` — do not assume it exists.
- Do not require 100% coverage; require tests for new business logic and bug fixes when practical.

## Validation commands

```bash
flutter test
flutter analyze
```
